classes\ that\ are\ api\ main\ classes\ should\ be\ contract\ types,\ because\ API\ code\ holds\ interfaces,\ records,\ enums,\ exceptions,\ annotations\ and\ final\ constant\ holders\ (only\ static\ final\ fields\ and\ a\ private\ constructor),\ carries\ no\ CDI\ scope,\ and\ depends\ only\ on\ java,\ javax,\ jakarta,\ org.eclipse.microprofile,\ annotation\ types\ and\ API\ code.\ A\ class\ is\ API,\ implementation\ or\ service\ code\ by\ its\ package\:\ io.freedriver.<project>\ or\ io.freedriver.<project>.<area>,\ then\ api,\ impl.<name>\ or\ service,\ and\ the\ packages\ below\ it.\ A\ class\ in\ any\ other\ package\ takes\ its\ module's\ role\:\ API\ for\ an\ artifactId\ ending\ -api,\ -model\ or\ -contract,\ implementation\ for\ one\ ending\ -impl,\ service\ for\ the\ rest=4d0cf6ed-0b50-4797-864c-5cb3d3073af6
classes\ that\ are\ main\ classes\ of\ our\ modules\ should\ be\ implementation\ code\ when\ they\ implement\ an\ API\ interface,\ because\ a\ main\ class\ that\ implements\ an\ API\ interface\ is\ implementation\ code;\ a\ JAX-RS\ resource\ may\ implement\ its\ JAX-RS\ API\ interface,\ a\ generated\ MicroProfile\ REST\ client\ is\ exempt,\ and\ a\ record,\ enum,\ interface,\ exception\ or\ permitted\ subtype\ of\ a\ sealed\ API\ interface\ in\ API\ code\ may\ implement\ an\ API\ interface.\ A\ class\ is\ API,\ implementation\ or\ service\ code\ by\ its\ package\:\ io.freedriver.<project>\ or\ io.freedriver.<project>.<area>,\ then\ api,\ impl.<name>\ or\ service,\ and\ the\ packages\ below\ it.\ A\ class\ in\ any\ other\ package\ takes\ its\ module's\ role\:\ API\ for\ an\ artifactId\ ending\ -api,\ -model\ or\ -contract,\ implementation\ for\ one\ ending\ -impl,\ service\ for\ the\ rest=1b7e63f6-4326-4a04-ac24-72a4fb33cd8a
classes\ that\ are\ main\ classes\ of\ our\ modules\ should\ keep\ implementation\ packages\ private,\ because\ an\ implementation\ is\ a\ package\ io.freedriver..impl.<name>\ and\ its\ subpackages;\ only\ its\ own\ classes\ depend\ on\ it,\ and\ it\ depends\ on\ no\ class\ in\ a\ package\ io.freedriver..service..\ and\ on\ no\ other\ implementation=78ce9456-520f-456b-92d2-09682fdbe23c
classes\ that\ are\ service\ main\ classes\ should\ depend\ only\ on\ the\ service\ allowlist,\ because\ service\ code\ depends\ only\ on\ java,\ javax,\ jakarta,\ io.quarkus\ except\ io.quarkus.mongodb.panache\ and\ io.quarkus.hibernate.orm.panache,\ io.smallrye,\ org.eclipse.microprofile,\ io.micrometer,\ annotation\ types,\ service\ code\ of\ its\ own\ module,\ API\ code\ and\ the\ utility\ artifactIds\ stereotypes,\ mcp-support,\ hit-window\ and\ freedriver-mqtt.\ A\ class\ is\ API,\ implementation\ or\ service\ code\ by\ its\ package\:\ io.freedriver.<project>\ or\ io.freedriver.<project>.<area>,\ then\ api,\ impl.<name>\ or\ service,\ and\ the\ packages\ below\ it.\ A\ class\ in\ any\ other\ package\ takes\ its\ module's\ role\:\ API\ for\ an\ artifactId\ ending\ -api,\ -model\ or\ -contract,\ implementation\ for\ one\ ending\ -impl,\ service\ for\ the\ rest.\ An\ HTTP\ edge\ class,\ one\ that\ observes\ io.quarkus.vertx.http.runtime.filters.Filters\ or\ io.vertx.ext.web.Router,\ has\ a\ method\ annotated\ @io.quarkus.vertx.web.Route\ or\ @io.quarkus.vertx.web.RouteFilter,\ or\ implements\ an\ io.quarkus.oidc\ interface,\ may\ also\ depend\ on\ io.vertx.core\ and\ io.vertx.ext.web.\ An\ MCP\ edge\ class,\ one\ with\ a\ method\ annotated\ from\ io.quarkiverse.mcp.server\ or\ that\ implements\ an\ interface\ from\ that\ package,\ may\ also\ depend\ on\ io.quarkiverse.mcp.server=179ba427-b892-438b-884f-fac4ec2acdd9
